{
    "title": "Solitaire TriPeaks Journey",
    "description": "<b>Join Claire on the Solitaire TriPeaks Adventure</b> for some solitaire and tripeaks puzzle fun. Play free solitaire online, make journey friends and unlock various TriPeaks levels! Sharpen your full deck solitaire skills, and have a blast!\r\n\r\nPlay solitaire tripeaks game free from anywhere with Solitaire TriPeaks Journey. Whether you're into the classic solitaire genre or the tripeaks game genre, this solitaire tripeaks game has got you covered. Train your brain and enjoy endless fun with your friends. Enjoy unlimited good times playing solitaire and tripeaks card games.\r\n\r\nExperience tripeaks solitaire games for free, with unique features including Magic Boosters, credits, and grand prizes. Explore hundreds of fun card levels and join millions on this animated solitaire tour.\r\n\r\n\u2b50 <b>SOLITAIRE TRIPEAKS JOURNEY FEATURES</b> \u2b50\r\n- Free solitaire card games with over 10,000 fun levels\r\n- New solitaire levels added every 2 weeks\r\n- Play tripeaks solitaire online with over 20 stunning card game themes to choose from\r\n- Playing card games comes easy when you practice your offline solitaire skills\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfd6 <b>ANIMATED SOLITAIRE WITH A FUN TWIST</b> \ud83c\udfd6\r\n- Fun card games, exciting events, merge side game and new scenery await on your very own tri peaks solitaire tour!\r\n- Play tripeaks solitaire online with exciting rewards and valuable hidden treasures\r\n- Animated solitaire and magical card games combine in Solitaire TriPeaks Journey\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfde <b>STUNNING GRAPHICS & THEMED SCENERY</b> \ud83c\udfde\r\n- Free card games with exciting gameplay & amazing graphics\r\n- Real solitaire free with over 20 stunning themes, like the Undersea World, Dark Forest, Savanna, Tropical Island & more is yours to explore\r\n- Play offline solitaire and practice your solitaire skills to win huge rewards\r\n- Each animated solitaire puzzle brings a card game with new stories to discover\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 <b>COMPETE & SHOW OFF YOUR SOLITAIRE SKILLS</b> \ud83c\udfc6\r\n- Free solitaire card games let you challenge players around the world\r\n- Play free card games online and advance through levels to become a solitaire champion!\r\n- Test your full deck solitaire skills and play cards online to climb tournament rankings\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude0d <b>Relaxing Tripeaks Side Games</b> \ud83d\ude0d\r\n- As you tackle those tripeaks card levels with your card games skills, get ready for daily and thrilling events on your entire tripeaks adventure! Grand prizes are prepared in various solitaire events.\r\nWhile using your solitaire skills to pass each tripeaks card levels, various exciting events are prepared every day throughout the whole tripeaks journey.\r\n- Love taking on fresh tripeaks challenges? The merge season is gearing up to amp up your solitaire gaming experience with extra fun!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf6 <b>OFFLINE SOLITAIRE TRIPEAKS LETS YOU PLAY FROM ANYWHERE </b>\ud83d\udcf6\r\n- Play free solitaire card games from anywhere and improve your solitaire puzzle skills\r\n- Enjoy fun card games without a WiFi connection by playing solitaire offline\r\n- Playing card games gets more challenging as you progress through the levels\r\n\r\nLove playing card games with real solitaire challenges? Play real solitaire tripeaks games for free, train your brain and solitaire skills and become the solitaire tripeaks master. Download Solitaire TriPeaks Journey and embark on a delightful solitaire tripeaks adventure today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Join Claire on the Solitaire TriPeaks Adventure</b> for some solitaire and tripeaks puzzle fun. Play free solitaire online, make journey friends and unlock various TriPeaks levels! Sharpen your full deck solitaire skills, and have a blast!<br><br>Play solitaire tripeaks game free from anywhere with Solitaire TriPeaks Journey. Whether you&#39;re into the classic solitaire genre or the tripeaks game genre, this solitaire tripeaks game has got you covered. Train your brain and enjoy endless fun with your friends. Enjoy unlimited good times playing solitaire and tripeaks card games.<br><br>Experience tripeaks solitaire games for free, with unique features including Magic Boosters, credits, and grand prizes. Explore hundreds of fun card levels and join millions on this animated solitaire tour.<br><br>\u2b50 <b>SOLITAIRE TRIPEAKS JOURNEY FEATURES</b> \u2b50<br>- Free solitaire card games with over 10,000 fun levels<br>- New solitaire levels added every 2 weeks<br>- Play tripeaks solitaire online with over 20 stunning card game themes to choose from<br>- Playing card games comes easy when you practice your offline solitaire skills<br><br>\ud83c\udfd6 <b>ANIMATED SOLITAIRE WITH A FUN TWIST</b> \ud83c\udfd6<br>- Fun card games, exciting events, merge side game and new scenery await on your very own tri peaks solitaire tour!<br>- Play tripeaks solitaire online with exciting rewards and valuable hidden treasures<br>- Animated solitaire and magical card games combine in Solitaire TriPeaks Journey<br><br>\ud83c\udfde <b>STUNNING GRAPHICS &amp; THEMED SCENERY</b> \ud83c\udfde<br>- Free card games with exciting gameplay &amp; amazing graphics<br>- Real solitaire free with over 20 stunning themes, like the Undersea World, Dark Forest, Savanna, Tropical Island &amp; more is yours to explore<br>- Play offline solitaire and practice your solitaire skills to win huge rewards<br>- Each animated solitaire puzzle brings a card game with new stories to discover<b